OTHER DEPENDENCIES
==================

Biorouter also builds on third-party libraries that are not redistributed as
standalone files but are compiled or bundled into its binaries in the ordinary
way, including the Rust MCP SDK (rmcp), Axum, sqlx, tiktoken-rs, minijinja and
the keyring crate on the Rust side, and Electron and React on the desktop side.
Their licences are recorded in Cargo.toml, Cargo.lock,
ui/desktop/package.json and ui/desktop/package-lock.json.

Biorouter's design drew on Aider, Cline, OpenCode and ForgeCode. No code from
those projects is included here.
